/** @mainpage FreshBooksDataProvider Module

    @tableofcontents

    @section freshbooksdataproviderintro FreshBooksDataProvider Introduction

    The %FreshBooksDataProvider module provides a data provider API for FreshBooks cloud
    accounting software.

    To use this module, use \c "%requires FreshBooksDataProvider" in your code.

    All the public symbols in the module are defined in the FreshBooksDataProvider namespace.

    The main classes are:
    - @ref FreshBooksDataProvider::FreshBooksDataProvider "FreshBooksDataProvider":
      the root data provider for FreshBooks
    - @ref FreshBooksDataProvider::FreshBooksDataProviderFactory "FreshBooksDataProviderFactory":
      the data provider factory for FreshBooks

    @section freshbooksdataproviderrelnotes Release Notes

    @subsection freshbooksdataproviderv1_0 FreshBooksDataProvider v1.0
    - the initial version of the %FreshBooksDataProvider module
*/

#! Contains all public definitions in the FreshBooksDataProvider module
